      //  Personal project: 4
      //
      //The goal of this project is to create a functional moisture level sensor that will tell a plant owner when their plant needs more water. 
      // In order to do this I created a simple if statement. The sensor itself is connected to one of the analog pins, so it can update when it changes.
      // When the plant needs more water it will show an image of a flower drooping with water around it
      // when the plant has too much water then it will display a flower with a sad face
      // When the plant has enough water it will be not have any particles around it and it will be have a neutral face
      // when the plant has the perfect amount of water then in will smile 
      // Each display update will also have the moisture level constantly updating on the screen
      // 
      // Components used: oled screen, esp32, 3d printed holder, rechargable battery, moisture sensor
      //


